# HouseAccount reads exactly three credentials, and every one of them is
# optional. Copy this file to `.env`, fill in whichever you have, and export it
# (`set -a; . ./.env; set +a`) before `make pipeline`. With none of them set the
# pipeline still scores all ~540 doors; each missing key costs one signal, and
# the loss is recorded in `degradations[]` in data/run_manifest.json rather than
# being papered over. Values here are empty on purpose -- never commit a key.

# Optional. Buys the vision stage: OpenAI gpt-4o-mini reads the NJ ortho tiles
# for pool, solar and exterior-condition signals. Unset, the stage declines
# before any tile is fetched and the R4 imagery terms are absent from scores.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Buys the Census ACS block-group prior (dual-income share, worth 5
# points). The ACS API refuses keyless callers, so unset means no block-group
# context; free key from https://api.census.gov/data/key_signup.html.
CENSUS_API_KEY=

# Optional, and unused by the pipeline today. Reserved for the demo-scale
# Street View look-up (GMP ToS 3.2.3 forbids a stored derived dataset, so no
# bulk signal will ever come from it). Leaving it unset changes nothing.
GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
